Arbor TypeScript SDK

This project is a TypeScript port of the Arbor Education PHP SDK
(https://github.com/arbor-education/sis-sdk-php), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes from the original: the code was rewritten in TypeScript, the HTTP
layer uses the Fetch API in place of PSR-7/17/18, all network operations
are asynchronous, and the model classes in src/models are generated from
the PHP model classes by scripts/generate-models.mjs.
